-- Income Tax Act 1947 — TESTS: FROM INCOME TO ASSESSABLE INCOME (Parts 3-9).
-- Expected values worked by hand from ../source/ITA1947.txt.

§ `Tests — income`

§§ `The charge and sources (ss 2A, 10, 12)`

#ASSERT NOT `within the charge to tax, being` `outside Singapore and not received in Singapore`
#ASSERT     `within the charge to tax, being` `received in Singapore from outside Singapore`
#ASSERT     `foreign income is received in Singapore, remitted:` FALSE `, applied to a trade debt:` TRUE `, applied to property brought in:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `foreign income is received in Singapore, remitted:` FALSE `, applied to a trade debt:` FALSE `, applied to property brought in:` FALSE
#ASSERT     `employment income is derived from Singapore, exercised here:` TRUE `, for the Government abroad:` FALSE `, citizen or resident:` FALSE
#ASSERT     `employment income is derived from Singapore, exercised here:` FALSE `, for the Government abroad:` TRUE `, citizen or resident:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `employment income is derived from Singapore, exercised here:` FALSE `, for the Government abroad:` FALSE `, citizen or resident:` TRUE

GIVEN borne IS A BOOLEAN, ded IS A BOOLEAN, loan IS A BOOLEAN, outside IS A BOOLEAN, soft IS A BOOLEAN, trip IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Deemed source facts`
`source facts` borne ded loan outside soft trip MEANS
    `Deemed source facts` WITH
        `borne by a Singapore resident or PE, not for a business abroad through a foreign PE` IS borne
        `deductible against income derived from Singapore` IS ded
        `loan funds brought into or used in Singapore` IS loan
        `performed outside Singapore by a non-resident not doing business here through a PE or otherwise` IS outside
        `software or digitised goods without a right to exploit the copyright` IS soft
        `rent for movable property used abroad on a business trip or for a representative office` IS trip

#ASSERT     `a payment of` `interest, or a payment for a loan's arrangement, management, guarantee or service` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT     `a payment of` `interest, or a payment for a loan's arrangement, management, guarantee or service` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `a payment of` `payment for know-how, or for assistance or service in applying it` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT     `a payment of` `payment for management or assistance in management` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `a payment of` `royalty or payment for the use of movable property` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `a payment of` `rent for movable property` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `a payment of` `royalty or payment for the use of movable property` `is deemed derived from Singapore:` (`source facts` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

§§ `Employment benefits and deeming rules (s 10)`

#ASSERT `the housing benefit, employer's rent` (JUST 36000) `, annual value` 30000 `, employee's rent` 6000 EQUALS 36000
#ASSERT `the housing benefit, employer's rent` NOTHING `, annual value` 30000 `, employee's rent` 6000 EQUALS 24000
-- s 10(6): (5 - 2) x 1,000
#ASSERT `the gain from an employee share right, price` 5 `, paid` 2 `, shares` 1000 EQUALS 3000
-- s 10(7)(c): the later of one month before cessation and the grant
#ASSERT `the date the s 10(7) gains are deemed derived, ceasing on` (YMD 2026 6 30) `, granted on` (YMD 2026 1 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 5 30
#ASSERT `the date the s 10(7) gains are deemed derived, ceasing on` (YMD 2026 6 30) `, granted on` (YMD 2026 6 15) EQUALS YMD 2026 6 15
#ASSERT     `the deemed exercise rule applies, foreigner leaving:` TRUE `, unexercised:` TRUE `, undertaking:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the deemed exercise rule applies, foreigner leaving:` TRUE `, unexercised:` TRUE `, undertaking:` TRUE
#ASSERT     `a revision under s 10(7AC) is still open for an event in` 2031 `, deemed in` 2026
#ASSERT NOT `a revision under s 10(7AC) is still open for an event in` 2032 `, deemed in` 2026
#ASSERT `the excess CPF contributions deemed income` 1200 `and` 800 EQUALS 2000
-- s 10(9): 3% of 100,000
#ASSERT `the annuity income, received` 5000 `, consideration` 100000 `, recovered:` FALSE `, employer-bought:` FALSE `, SRS:` FALSE EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the annuity income, received` 5000 `, consideration` 100000 `, recovered:` TRUE `, employer-bought:` FALSE `, SRS:` FALSE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the annuity income, received` 5000 `, consideration` 100000 `, recovered:` FALSE `, employer-bought:` FALSE `, SRS:` TRUE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT NOT `the payment is income, being maintenance:` TRUE
-- s 10(14)-(14B): lesser of net and 10% (YA 2026), 40% (YA 2027), 70% (YA 2028) of gross; none from YA 2029
#ASSERT `the author's royalty income for YA` 2026 `, gross` 100000 `, net` 60000 `, newspaper:` FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the author's royalty income for YA` 2027 `, gross` 100000 `, net` 60000 `, newspaper:` FALSE EQUALS 40000
#ASSERT `the author's royalty income for YA` 2028 `, gross` 100000 `, net` 60000 `, newspaper:` FALSE EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `the author's royalty income for YA` 2029 `, gross` 100000 `, net` 60000 `, newspaper:` FALSE EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `the author's royalty income for YA` 2026 `, gross` 100000 `, net` 60000 `, newspaper:` TRUE EQUALS 60000
-- s 10G: 50% on retirement; 5% penalty on a premature withdrawal
#ASSERT `the SRS withdrawal of` 30000 `, contributed` 0 `, on ground` `on or after the prescribed retirement age at first contribution` EQUALS `SRS result` OF 15000, 0
#ASSERT `the SRS withdrawal of` 30000 `, contributed` 0 `, on ground` `before the prescribed retirement age, on no special ground` EQUALS `SRS result` OF 30000, 1500
#ASSERT `the SRS withdrawal of` 30000 `, contributed` 10000 `, on ground` `on incapacity, mental disorder or terminal illness` EQUALS `SRS result` OF 10000, 0

GIVEN sold IS A DATE, group IS A BOOLEAN, ip IS A BOOLEAN, excl IS A BOOLEAN, other IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Foreign asset sale`
`a foreign sale on` sold group ip excl other MEANS
    `Foreign asset sale` WITH
        `sold on` IS sold
        `the seller is a member of a relevant group` IS group
        `the asset is situated outside Singapore` IS TRUE
        `gains received in Singapore` IS 100000
        `otherwise chargeable as income under s 10(1)` IS other
        `otherwise exempt from tax` IS FALSE
        `an intellectual property right` IS ip
        `incidental to a prescribed financial institution's business, or to an incentive-income activity` IS FALSE
        `an excluded entity in the basis period` IS excl
        `deductible expenditure and losses` IS 30000

-- s 10L: 100,000 received less 30,000 deductible
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2024 6 1) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 70000
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2023 12 31) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2024 6 1) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2024 6 1) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 70000
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2024 6 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the foreign asset gains chargeable under s 10L:` (`a foreign sale on` (YMD 2024 6 1) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 0
-- s 11(1)
#ASSERT     `the club is deemed to carry on a business, member receipts` 40 `of` 100
#ASSERT NOT `the club is deemed to carry on a business, member receipts` 50 `of` 100

